  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Aviation Security Reverse Trade Mission, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a reverse trade mission (RTM) to introduce Vietnamese aviation officials from the Ministry of Transportation, Civil Aviation Authority of Vietnam, Airports Corporation of Vietnam, the General Department of Vietnam Customs and/or other aviation stakeholders to familiarize them with U.S. equipment, solutions and best practices for aviation security. The delegates will visit multiple U.S. cities to meet with U.S. government and industry, and participate in site visits to airports.</narrative>
  </description>
